    ''full_domain_disabled'' is not declared'
...
assert(#full_domain_enabled == 5, 'new-planner full signed domain row count: '..#full_domain_enabled)
---
- error: '[string "return assert(#full_domain_enabled == 5, ''new..."]:1: variable
